**US Tariffs on Chinese EVs:**

The US has imposed tariffs on Chinese EVs, which has made them more expensive for American consumers. This has led to a decline in Chinese EV sales in the US market. However, some Chinese EV manufacturers, such as BYD and Geely, have found ways to circumvent the tariffs by importing EVs from other countries.

