**CONCLUSION:**

The adoption of AI and ML in the semiconductor industry is gaining momentum, and it's expected to continue growing in the coming years. As companies continue to invest in AI and ML, we can expect to see significant improvements in design and manufacturing efficiency, leading to higher-quality, lower-power, and more cost-effective products.

